OL,3,APolice officer dies and another injured
OL,4,Aafter backpack explosion in Oviedo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has died and another
OL,7,Fhas been injured in the northern
OL,8,FSpanish city of Oviedo after an
OL,9,Fexplosive device went off at the scene
OL,10,Fof a shooting.
OL,12,FThe blast happened when officers from
OL,13,FSpain's canine unit and explosives
OL,14,Fdisposal unit arrived and examined a
OL,15,Fsuspicious backpack following reports
OL,16,Fof a dispute between neighbours on
OL,17,FTuesday morning.
OL,19,FA woman who had been shot and the
OL,20,Finjured officer have been taken to
OL,21,Fhospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
